<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Weazel combat experience serum -->
  <Weazel_ExperienceSerum_Combat.label>鼬族战斗经验血清</Weazel_ExperienceSerum_Combat.label>
  <!-- EN: A serum of Purified Essence infused with the combat memories of veteran Weazel soldiers. The injected Weazel gains 2 levels in both Shooting and Melee, and immediately goes through a top-tier growth moment.\n\nCauses learning sickness for 6 days after injection. Each Weazel can receive only one of the three experience serums, once in their lifetime, and only from age 5.\n\nExperience injection theory has only recently begun to draw attention. It started from a simple idea: if Essence could turn 'experience' into a product, countless clones could be raised into elites in a short time. The theory compiles the 'instincts' every living thing has inherited through its genes into vast amounts of data, builds artificial 'memories' from them, and delivers those memories through mechanites, so that each Weazel can be placed exactly where it is needed. Many Weazels regard receiving an experience serum as a kind of coming-of-age rite. -->
  <Weazel_ExperienceSerum_Combat.description>融入资深鼬族士兵战斗记忆的纯化精华血清。注射的鼬族射击与格斗各提升2级，并立即迎来最高等级的成长时刻。\n\n注射后6天内会出现学习晕眩。每名鼬族一生只能从三种经验血清中选一种注射一次，且须年满5岁。\n\n经验注入理论直到最近才开始受到关注。它源自一个简单的想法：如果能用精华把“经验”变成商品，就能在短时间内把无数复制体培养成精锐。这套理论将所有生命透过基因代代相传的“本能”汇整成庞大的资料，据此打造出人造的“记忆”，再以机械分子注入，让每名鼬族都能被安排到最需要的位置。不少鼬族把注射经验血清视为一种成年礼。</Weazel_ExperienceSerum_Combat.description>
